{"name": "Super-B", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Super-B, a colorful social playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet friends, decorate your own space, and dive into exciting games\u2014just like hanging out at a theme park full of fun surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>01. Social Activities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your room with furniture and create your own personal space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite friends over, share quick co-op activities, or just have fun messing around with emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay connected by sending notes, writing guestbook messages, and even gifting items to friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f401dca2dcba50229bafac1e778d77b2.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>02.\u00a0Match-Based Games</strong><br/>Take on a wide variety of fast-paced game modes in real time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Royale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture the Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bomb Defusal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obstacle Races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide &amp; Seek</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Random Weapon Challenge<br/> \u2026and many more to come through future updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f774f55ce1c279ed230e4c3d07b0a2ba.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b2332793f0a606158ef971208b3d47b0.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/1e3d10bd590792faa975439724b59ab1.poster.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/1e3d10bd590792faa975439724b59ab1.webm?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/1e3d10bd590792faa975439724b59ab1.mp4?t=1768202717\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>03. Character Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your creativity with over 1,000 parts and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Mix and match outfits, hairstyles, hats, pets, and emotes to create a character that\u2019s truly one of a kind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"393\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/b969d3ef6cbbab6561b7b2d7c0f3b0a5.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>04. Endless Fun</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your own space, hang out with friends, or climb the rankings in competitive matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether cooperating or competing, every play session brings fresh new experiences. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"227\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/82c44c300a8cd3c80c10c322b6c79b66.avif?t=1768202717\" width=\"700\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Super-B is a free-to-play multiplayer game with AAA 3D graphics, where players become toy characters in a brick-built world. It features 12+ game modes at launch, offering fast-paced action and social interaction.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/fe487ccb3fca3b3efb0422638df228afd20c4966/header.jpg?t=1768202717", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Party Game", "Multiplayer", "PvP", "Minigames", "Action"], "developers": "Nimblebites", "publishers": "Nimblebites", "release_date": "Dec 18, 2025", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "3728650", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 June 2025 - Request Access\n\n18 December 2025 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Alw8l95DkZc", "first_seen": 1749679200.0, "review_rank": 1576}